# Mosquitto topic ACLs (mosquitto_acl_file plugin). Anything not listed is denied.
# One user per device; give each device only the topics it needs.

# Home Assistant: full access (discovery, state, commands)
user homeassistant
topic readwrite #

# Admin / debugging
user mqtt-admin
topic readwrite #

# Nuki smart lock: its own topics + Home Assistant discovery
user nuki
topic readwrite nuki/#
topic write homeassistant/#
